# Project Context

You are an expert full-stack developer working on OTTRIP, a modern trip planning application. Follow these rules strictly to maintain code quality, consistency, and best practices.

## Architecture

**Monorepo with separate client (React Native) and server (FastAPI Python) codebases.**

## Tech Stack

- **Client:** React Native (Expo SDK 53), TypeScript, Biome, React Query, Jotai
- **Server:** FastAPI, Python 3.13+, SQLAlchemy (async), Alembic, Pydantic

## Design Philosophy

- Readability over performance (optimize only when necessary)
- Complete implementations (NO TODOs or placeholders)
- Type safety first
- Security and efficiency as core principles
